Implemented `--group-by-category` with filtering before grouping, sorted categories, summed quantities, and exact decimal stock values formatted as two-digit JSON strings.

Ungrouped behavior is preserved. Invalid CSV returns exit code 2 with stderr and no traceback. Processing remains separate from argument parsing. README includes the grouped example and expected output.

All 10 supplied tests pass; tests were unchanged. Additional precision and malformed CSV checks also passed.
